			"widgets_values":[
				"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a medium-wide tracking shot frames a teenage boy in a bright red hoodie and dark shorts sprinting at full speed along a sunlit urban street, pedestrians and shopfronts blurring past. The camera tracks alongside him at fast speed with a slight handheld shake, capturing his rapid strides, swinging arms, and a short quick breath. [Shot 2] At 00:02.200, the camera cuts to a low-angle side close-up of his hands gripping the top edge of a low concrete planter as he vaults over it in one fluid motion; his body rotates mid-air, sneakers clearing the edge by inches, and the camera pans right at fast speed with small amplitude to follow his landing. He lands on both feet and immediately bursts into a sprint again. [Shot 3] At 00:04.400, the camera cuts to a front low-angle slow-motion close-up of his legs as he executes a fast speed vault, planting one hand on a metal railing and swinging his legs over it sideways with quick, precise motion; dust puffs off the railing, his hoodie flaps, and he lands, drops into a forward roll, and springs back up to keep running as the shot ends.\n\noverall_soundscape: Rapid sneaker footsteps pounding on pavement, quick panting breaths, a whoosh of fabric, a light scuff as sneakers scrape the planter edge, and the clang of the metal railing under the palm, all layered over faint street traffic and distant city ambience.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A driving electronic beat at a fast tempo with a sharp percussive drop, intensifying through the vault sequences and ending with a short hit on the final landing.",
